---
import Base from "../layouts/Base.astro";
---

<Base
    title="App"
    description="Message through a Tern node from your browser, over USB or Bluetooth. Nothing leaves your device but what the node sends by radio."
>
    <section class="app wrap">
        <div id="gate">
            <h1>Tern, in your browser</h1>
            <p class="lede">
                Write to other nodes through a Tern node of your own: one plugged into this computer,
                or one in Bluetooth's reach of it or of an Android phone. The page talks to the node
                and to nothing else: there is no account and no server, and what you write leaves
                this device only by the node's radio.
            </p>
            <p class="buttons">
                <button id="connect-serial" type="button">Connect over USB</button>
                <button id="connect-bluetooth" type="button">Connect over Bluetooth</button>
                <button id="connect-demo" type="button">Try it without a board</button>
            </p>
            <p id="unsupported" class="note" hidden></p>
            <ul class="muted notes">
                <li>
                    The board needs Tern's firmware: <a href="/flash">put it on a Heltec V3</a> from this
                    browser.
                </li>
                <li>
                    Over Bluetooth, the node asks for a passkey the first time: it is on the node's
                    screen. The node's <code>forget</code> command, over USB, makes every device pair
                    again.
                </li>
                <li>
                    This is an alpha of a draft protocol. Its cryptography has not been reviewed:
                    do not trust it with anything that matters.
                </li>
                <li>
                    Conversations are also kept in this browser, since a node remembers only its
                    latest messages.
                </li>
                <li>
                    Sharing your position from here gives the node the browser's location only
                    while this page is open: for sharing from a pocket, use a phone app.
                </li>
            </ul>
        </div>

        <p id="demo-note" class="note" hidden>
            A demo: there is no node, and every name and message here is made up.
        </p>

        <div id="live" hidden>
            <aside>
                <div id="node" class="card"></div>
                <div id="update" class="card" hidden></div>
                <details id="settings" class="card">
                    <summary>Settings</summary>
                    <form id="settings-form">
                        <label for="set-power">Transmit power, in dBm</label>
                        <input id="set-power" type="number" min="-9" max="22" step="1" required />
                        <label for="set-region">Region</label>
                        <select id="set-region">
                            <option value="US915">US915: United States, Canada</option>
                            <option value="EU868">EU868: Europe</option>
                        </select>
                        <label for="set-role">Role</label>
                        <select id="set-role">
                            <option value="1">Relay: passes others' frames on</option>
                            <option value="0">Leaf: sends and receives its own</option>
                        </select>
                        <p class="muted small-print">
                            The board sends on its region's frequency: choose the one you are in.
                            It restarts to apply a change, and refuses a power its region does not
                            allow.
                        </p>
                        <button id="settings-apply" type="submit">Apply</button>
                    </form>
                </details>
                <details id="card-settings" class="card" hidden>
                    <summary>Your presence card</summary>
                    <form id="card-form">
                        <p id="card-state" class="muted small-print"></p>
                        <label class="check"><input id="card-on" type="checkbox" /> Send it</label>
                        <label for="card-name">The name it carries</label>
                        <input id="card-name" type="text" autocomplete="off" maxlength="31" placeholder="empty for none; sent in clear" />
                        <p class="muted small-print">
                            A card tells the nodes near this one, two hops round and every couple of
                            hours, its address and this name, so that people about can find and add
                            it. It is off until you turn it on.
                        </p>
                        <button type="submit">Apply</button>
                    </form>
                </details>
                <p><button id="disconnect" type="button" class="small">Disconnect</button></p>
                <ul id="asked" class="list plain"></ul>
                <h2>People</h2>
                <ul id="people" class="list"></ul>
                <form id="add" class="card">
                    <label for="add-address">Add someone by their node's address</label>
                    <input id="add-address" type="text" autocomplete="off" spellcheck="false" placeholder="64 hex digits, or its link" required />
                    <label for="add-name">Name</label>
                    <input id="add-name" type="text" autocomplete="off" maxlength="31" placeholder="for you; never sent by radio" />
                    <button type="submit">Add</button>
                </form>
                <h2>Groups</h2>
                <ul id="groups" class="list"></ul>
                <p id="groups-old" class="muted small-print" hidden>
                    This node's firmware is from before groups. <a href="/flash">Update it</a> to
                    make and join them.
                </p>
                <p id="groups-demo" class="muted small-print" hidden>The demo has no groups.</p>
                <form id="group-add" class="card">
                    <label for="group-name">Make a group</label>
                    <input id="group-name" type="text" autocomplete="off" maxlength="31" placeholder="a name, for you; never sent by radio" required />
                    <button type="submit">Make</button>
                </form>
                <form id="group-join" class="card" hidden>
                    <label for="join-code">Join from a code</label>
                    <input id="join-code" type="text" autocomplete="off" spellcheck="false" placeholder="HTTPS://TERNMESH.ORG/G#…" required />
                    <button type="submit">Join</button>
                </form>
                <h2 id="about-head" hidden>Who's about</h2>
                <ul id="about" class="list plain" hidden></ul>
                <h2 id="places-head" hidden>Positions</h2>
                <ul id="places" class="list plain" hidden></ul>
                <h2>Neighbours</h2>
                <ul id="neighbours" class="list plain"></ul>
            </aside>
            <section id="talk">
                <header id="talk-head"></header>
                <ol id="messages"></ol>
                <form id="compose" hidden>
                    <label for="text" class="sr">Message</label>
                    <input id="text" type="text" autocomplete="off" placeholder="Write a message" />
                    <span id="counter" class="muted"></span>
                    <button type="submit" class="primary">Send</button>
                </form>
            </section>
        </div>

        <p id="status" role="status" aria-live="polite"></p>

        <details id="console" hidden>
            <summary>The board's console</summary>
            <pre id="console-text"></pre>
            <form id="console-form">
                <label for="console-line" class="sr">A command for the board</label>
                <input id="console-line" type="text" autocomplete="off" spellcheck="false" placeholder="status, routes, peers…" />
                <button type="submit" class="small">Send</button>
            </form>
        </details>
    </section>
</Base>

<script>
    import "../lib/app/main.ts";
</script>

<style is:global>
    /* Global, and under .app: the page's script makes most of these elements, and a scoped
       style would not reach them. */
    .app {
        padding-top: 32px;
        padding-bottom: 48px;
    }
    .app [hidden] {
        display: none !important;
    }
    .app h1 {
        font-size: clamp(1.8rem, 4vw, 2.6rem);
        margin: 0 0 12px;
    }
    .app h2 {
        font-size: 1rem;
        margin: 20px 0 8px;
    }
    .app .lede {
        max-width: 44rem;
        font-size: 1.1rem;
    }
    .app .notes {
        max-width: 44rem;
        padding-left: 1.2em;
        font-size: 0.95rem;
    }
    .app .note {
        background: var(--accent-soft);
        border: 1px solid var(--border);
        border-radius: var(--radius);
        padding: 10px 14px;
        max-width: 44rem;
    }
    .app button {
        font: inherit;
        padding: 9px 16px;
        border-radius: var(--radius);
        border: 1px solid var(--border);
        background: var(--surface);
        color: var(--text);
        cursor: pointer;
    }
    .app button:hover:not(:disabled) {
        border-color: var(--accent);
    }
    .app button:disabled {
        opacity: 0.5;
        cursor: not-allowed;
    }
    .app button.primary {
        background: var(--accent);
        border-color: var(--accent);
        color: var(--bg);
        font-weight: 600;
    }
    .app button.small {
        padding: 3px 10px;
        font-size: 0.85rem;
    }
    .app .buttons {
        display: flex;
        flex-wrap: wrap;
        gap: 10px;
    }
    .app input[type="text"] {
        font: inherit;
        width: 100%;
        padding: 8px 10px;
        border-radius: var(--radius);
        border: 1px solid var(--border);
        background: var(--surface);
        color: var(--text);
    }
    .app .sr {
        position: absolute;
        width: 1px;
        height: 1px;
        overflow: hidden;
        clip-path: inset(50%);
    }
    .app #live {
        display: grid;
        grid-template-columns: minmax(0, 19rem) minmax(0, 1fr);
        gap: 24px;
        align-items: start;
    }
    @media (max-width: 46rem) {
        .app #live {
            grid-template-columns: minmax(0, 1fr);
        }
    }
    .app .card {
        background: var(--surface);
        border: 1px solid var(--border);
        border-radius: var(--radius);
        padding: 12px 14px;
    }
    .app .card h2 {
        margin-top: 0;
    }
    .app #live.busy {
        opacity: 0.6;
    }
    .app #settings,
    .app #card-settings,
    .app #update {
        margin-top: 12px;
    }
    .app #settings summary,
    .app #card-settings summary {
        cursor: pointer;
        font-weight: 600;
    }
    .app #settings form,
    .app #card-settings form {
        margin-top: 10px;
    }
    .app #settings input:not([type="checkbox"]),
    .app #settings select,
    .app #card-settings input:not([type="checkbox"]),
    .app form.share select {
        font: inherit;
        width: 100%;
        box-sizing: border-box;
        padding: 8px 10px;
        border-radius: var(--radius);
        border: 1px solid var(--border);
        background: var(--bg);
        color: var(--text);
    }
    .app .small-print {
        font-size: 0.85rem;
        margin: 10px 0 0;
    }
    .app #asked:empty {
        display: none;
    }
    .app #asked li {
        background: var(--accent-soft);
        border: 1px solid var(--border);
        border-radius: var(--radius);
        padding: 10px 12px;
        margin-bottom: 8px;
        font-size: 0.95rem;
    }
    .app #asked p {
        margin: 0 0 8px;
    }
    .app #asked code {
        overflow-wrap: anywhere;
        font-size: 0.8rem;
    }
    .app #asked .actions {
        display: flex;
        gap: 8px;
        margin: 0;
    }
    .app .card label {
        display: block;
        font-size: 0.85rem;
        margin: 8px 0 4px;
    }
    .app .card label:first-child {
        margin-top: 0;
    }
    .app .card button[type="submit"] {
        margin-top: 10px;
    }
    .app .card label.check {
        display: flex;
        gap: 8px;
        align-items: center;
        font-size: 0.95rem;
    }
    .app #group-join {
        margin-top: 8px;
    }
    .app .join-code {
        margin: 8px 0 12px;
        max-width: 22rem;
    }
    /* Black on white whatever the theme: some scanners will not read a code the other way round. */
    .app .join-code .qr {
        display: block;
        width: 100%;
        max-width: 16rem;
        height: auto;
        border-radius: 4px;
    }
    .app .join-code .link {
        overflow-wrap: anywhere;
        font-size: 0.8rem;
    }
    .app .join-code .actions {
        display: flex;
        gap: 8px;
        margin: 8px 0 0;
    }
    .app #update progress {
        width: 100%;
    }
    .app form.share {
        margin: 8px 0 12px;
        max-width: 28rem;
    }
    .app .address {
        display: flex;
        gap: 8px;
        align-items: flex-start;
        margin: 0 0 6px;
    }
    .app .address code {
        overflow-wrap: anywhere;
        font-size: 0.8rem;
        line-height: 1.4;
    }
    .app .facts {
        margin: 0;
        font-size: 0.85rem;
    }
    .app .list {
        list-style: none;
        margin: 0 0 12px;
        padding: 0;
    }
    .app .list.plain li {
        font-size: 0.9rem;
        padding: 2px 0;
    }
    .app .list .empty {
        font-size: 0.9rem;
    }
    .app .person {
        display: flex;
        align-items: center;
        gap: 8px;
        width: 100%;
        text-align: left;
        margin-bottom: 6px;
    }
    .app .person.on {
        border-color: var(--accent);
        background: var(--accent-soft);
    }
    .app .person .name {
        flex: 1;
        overflow: hidden;
        text-overflow: ellipsis;
        white-space: nowrap;
    }
    .app .badge {
        background: var(--accent);
        color: var(--bg);
        border-radius: 999px;
        padding: 0 8px;
        font-size: 0.8rem;
        font-weight: 600;
    }
    .app .session {
        font-size: 0.7rem;
    }
    .app #talk {
        background: var(--surface);
        border: 1px solid var(--border);
        border-radius: var(--radius);
        padding: 14px 16px;
        min-height: 24rem;
        display: flex;
        flex-direction: column;
    }
    .app #talk-head h2 {
        margin: 0 0 4px;
        font-size: 1.2rem;
    }
    .app #talk-head p {
        margin: 0 0 4px;
        font-size: 0.85rem;
    }
    .app #talk-head .actions {
        display: flex;
        gap: 8px;
        margin: 8px 0 0;
    }
    .app #talk-head:empty + #messages {
        border-top: 0;
        padding-top: 0;
        margin-top: 0;
    }
    .app #messages {
        list-style: none;
        margin: 12px 0;
        padding: 12px 0 0;
        border-top: 1px solid var(--border);
        flex: 1;
        max-height: 60vh;
        overflow-y: auto;
        display: flex;
        flex-direction: column;
        gap: 8px;
    }
    .app #messages li.in,
    .app #messages li.out {
        max-width: 80%;
        padding: 8px 12px;
        border-radius: var(--radius);
        border: 1px solid var(--border);
    }
    .app #messages li.in {
        align-self: flex-start;
        background: var(--bg);
    }
    .app #messages li.out {
        align-self: flex-end;
        background: var(--accent-soft);
    }
    .app #messages li.failed {
        border-style: dashed;
    }
    .app #messages .text {
        margin: 0;
        overflow-wrap: anywhere;
        white-space: pre-wrap;
    }
    .app #messages .who {
        margin: 0 0 2px;
        font-size: 0.8rem;
        font-weight: 600;
        opacity: 0.8;
    }
    .app #messages .actions {
        margin: 6px 0 0;
    }
    .app #messages .meta {
        margin: 2px 0 0;
        font-size: 0.75rem;
        color: var(--muted);
    }
    .app #compose {
        display: flex;
        gap: 8px;
        align-items: center;
    }
    .app #counter {
        font-size: 0.8rem;
        white-space: nowrap;
    }
    .app #status {
        min-height: 1.6em;
        margin: 12px 0 0;
        color: var(--muted);
    }
    .app .bad {
        color: #b3261e;
    }
    @media (prefers-color-scheme: dark) {
        .app .bad {
            color: #f2b8b5;
        }
    }
    .app #console {
        margin-top: 16px;
    }
    .app #console pre {
        background: var(--surface);
        border: 1px solid var(--border);
        border-radius: var(--radius);
        padding: 10px;
        max-height: 16rem;
        overflow: auto;
        font-size: 0.8rem;
        white-space: pre-wrap;
        overflow-wrap: anywhere;
    }
    .app #console form {
        display: flex;
        gap: 8px;
    }
</style>
